      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "והוכיח",
      "rationale": "Sampela i tanim 'em bai kotim ol tok' (Yahwe i skelim), sampela 'em baiskelim man' — Hebriw i tok 'kotim long ol tok' tasol."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "bai",
      "rationale": "אולי ישמע — Hebriw i no gat mak bilong taim bihain; Tok Pisin i putim 'bai' bilong stretim."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "yu",
      "rationale": "Hizkiyau i tok long Yeshayahu profet — 'yu ken leftimapim praia bilong yu'."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Maski Yahwe Elohim bilong yu bai i harim ⟨את⟩ olgeta tok bilong Ravshake, we king bilong Ashur, masta bilong em, i salim em long tok nogut long Elohim i gat laip — na em bai kotim ol tok we Yahwe Elohim bilong yu i harim. Olsem, yu ken leftimapim praia bilong yu bilong olgeta man i stap liklik yet.",
